#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
TRACEATLAS / MODELINT — Local defensive AI model intelligence pipeline.

IMPORTANT SAFETY / POLICY NOTES:
- This is a local demo implementation.
- It does NOT access live model providers, APIs, registries, repositories, or inference servers.
- It does NOT steal, extract, reconstruct, or exfiltrate model weights, proprietary models,
  training data, or private user data.
- It does NOT use stolen API keys, bypass authentication, evade rate limits or billing.
- It does NOT generate or optimize malicious jailbreaks, safety bypasses, poisoning payloads,
  backdoors, or harmful model packages.
- It does NOT execute unknown checkpoint/repository code or load untrusted artifacts.
- It supports authorized, defensive, evidence-first AI model intelligence only.
- Sample data is synthetic.
"""

